# {{ProjectName}} - mobile API coverage

This wrapper was generated from **both web and mobile** traffic captures
when available. Mobile apps often expose a richer or different API surface
(internal endpoints, additional fields, alternative auth shapes) than the
public website, so including mobile traffic produces a more complete
client.

