{{MobileHarPaths}}
```

When `HasMobileCoverage` is `false`, the generated `Client.cs` covers only
web endpoints. Re-run the scaffold agent and answer `y` at the Phase 1.5
prompt to incorporate mobile traffic.

## Re-capturing mobile traffic

Use the companion script:

```pwsh
node templates/web-api-discovery/scripts/capture/import-mobile-app.js \
  --platform=android --mode=proxy
```

See the agent's Phase 1.5 documentation for the full instruction set
(mitmproxy / Charles setup, CA cert install, jadx / class-dump for
decompile-mode discovery).

## Legal note

Decompilation must only be performed against apps you are legally
permitted to inspect (your own account, or where the target Terms of
Service permit security research).